  "method": {
    "source": "Independent minidom text-node projection from seven SHA-pinned canonical XML files. All 704 paragraphs are restored exactly and every source-to-record slice is compared. Paragraph sameAs identities remain literal source anchors. The single supplied element spans VII.208–209 and its nested 209 milestone; original text, exact clipped UTF-16 offsets and attributes are retained. Book V chapter 13 keeps its absent type attribute. All 4,001 Niese units follow source order.",
